================ Replica demo: primary (5432) + streaming replica (5433) ================

### 1. Who is who
PRIMARY port 5432  in_recovery=false
REPLICA port 5433  in_recovery=true

### 2. Write on the REPLICA must be rejected
ERROR:  cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction
